---
source: crates/keyway-cli/src/cli/test.rs
expression: text
---
$ keyway --lst
Error: unknown option "--lst"
Fix: keyway accepts --help, --json, --no-color, --non-interactive, --print, --version. Did you mean --list?

$ keyway list --lsit
Error: unknown option "--lsit"
Fix: keyway list accepts --help, --json, --no-color, --non-interactive, --recent, --version. Did you mean --list?

$ keyway --bogus
Error: unknown option "--bogus"
Fix: keyway accepts --help, --json, --no-color, --non-interactive, --print, --version.

$ keyway help lst
Error: unknown command "lst"
Fix: did you mean `keyway help list`? See all commands with `keyway --help`.

$ keyway help bogus
Error: unknown command "bogus"
Fix: see all commands with `keyway --help`.

$ keyway consul < /dev/null
Error: 4 hosts match "consul", and the picker needs an interactive terminal
Fix: narrow the query to one host, or list them with `keyway ls consul`.

$ TERM=dumb keyway consul
Error: 4 hosts match "consul", and the picker needs a terminal that moves the cursor (TERM=dumb)
Fix: narrow the query to one host, or list them with `keyway ls consul`.

$ keyway --non-interactive
Error: 12 hosts to choose from, and --non-interactive never opens the picker
Fix: narrow the query to one host, or list them with `keyway ls`.

$ keyway lst new < /dev/null
Error: no host matches "lst new"
Fix: did you mean `keyway list new`?

$ keyway nope < /dev/null
Error: no host matches "nope"
Fix: list every host with `keyway ls`.

$ keyway inspekt stg-consul1 < /dev/null
Error: no host matches "inspekt stg-consul1"
Fix: did you mean `keyway inspect stg-consul1`?

$ keyway inspect
Error: keyway inspect needs a query
Fix: name a host, as in `keyway inspect stg-consul1`, or list them with `keyway ls`.

$ keyway --json
Error: keyway pick takes --json only with --print
Fix: print the picked host as JSON with `keyway --print --json`, or list hosts with `keyway ls --json`.

$ keyway ls --print
Error: unknown option "--print"
Fix: keyway list accepts --help, --json, --no-color, --non-interactive, --recent, --version.

$ keyway --print  # stdout is full
Error: cannot print the host: No space left on device (os error 28)

$ keyway doctor extra
Error: unexpected argument "extra" for keyway doctor
Fix: keyway doctor accepts --help, --json, --no-color, --non-interactive, --version.

$ keyway inspect consul
Error: 3 hosts match "consul"; inspect needs exactly one
Fix: name one of stg-consul1, stg-consul2, stg-consul3, or list them with `keyway ls consul`.

$ keyway inspect web
Error: 8 hosts match "web"; inspect needs exactly one
Fix: name one of web1, web2, web3, web4, web5 and 3 more, or list them with `keyway ls web`.

$ keyway inspect stg-broken
Error: /home/me/.ssh/config: terminating, 1 bad configuration options

$ keyway inspect stg-slow
Error: ssh -G gave no answer within 2 s
Fix: retry once; if it stays slow, time `ssh -G -- <host>` yourself: a `Match exec` or `ProxyCommand` in the config is probably waiting on something.

$ keyway  # no Host lines
Error: no hosts found in ~/.ssh/config or the files it Includes
Fix: add `Host` lines; ENV and WHAT come from comments.
Learn More: https://github.com/PunGrumpy/keyway/blob/main/docs/configuration.md#config-conventions

$ keyway  # no ~/.ssh/config
Error: cannot read /nonexistent-home/.ssh/config: No such file or directory (os error 2)

$ keyway  # no HOME
Error: cannot find the home directory

$ keyway stg-consul1  # no ssh
Error: cannot run ssh: No such file or directory (os error 2)
Fix: install OpenSSH, or put `ssh` on your PATH.

$ keyway stg-consul1  # ssh refused
Error: cannot run ssh: Permission denied (os error 13)

$ keyway ls  # stdout is full
Error: cannot write the host list: No space left on device (os error 28)
